WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:01.970
...a cooking contest!

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.050
What do we do about this?

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.330
Easy.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.080
No matter what they cook, 
we just have to eat it.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.330
If you die, I'll take care of 
all your affairs for you.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.070
Oh, I'm making sure you eat.
 If I die, so do you.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:18.740
Nope.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.820
You're eating!

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:20.440
Nope.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.350
You're eating!

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.250
Nope.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.480
You're eating!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.940
All right, you high school boys.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.070
There's this thing called tact. Get some!

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:28.430
Ow!

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:28.680
Ow!

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:33.170
Now, if we're having a cooking contest,
 we'll need a theme.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.090
Look, let's just compare local 
instant ramen flavors.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:42.040
You're normally scum, 
but sometimes, you're a genius.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.850
That wouldn't be any fun.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.550
But we don't want anything 
too difficult, so...

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.310
Th-Then how about fried chicken?

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.310
Oh, what about hotpot, then?

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:51.160
That's it!

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:51.800
Good idea!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.390
That's fine with me.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:55.250
U-Um, I think fried chicken is—

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.930
Okay, hotpot it is!

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:57.990
All right!

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:57.990
Yeah!

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:57.990
Okay!

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.120
Fried chicken...

