00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.240
Rena-san!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.430
Come over here and have fun with us.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:54.420
To tell you the truth, I've never gone 
on any trips other than school events,

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:57.320
so I kinda don't know where I should be.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.790
Then would you like to shop with me?

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.960
I appreciate your thoughtfulness!

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.450
You don't need to be so polite.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.580
We're the same age, after all.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.290
I could say the same to you.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:23.050
So I just wish you would do your best 
to accept her with an open mind. {ep7 final}

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.170
I know you.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.750
You're thinking about 
Shida-chan, aren't you?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:28.760
Wha—

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.990
Up until now, you always made 
up right away after a fight.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:34.790
This time is no different 
than all the rest!

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.510
Don't bother acting tough.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:38.480
When you're stuck in a mess this bad,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.330
you two are gonna be 
awkward for a long time,

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.980
even if you get to talking for 
the same reasons as usual.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.210
What would you do in my position?

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:47.730
Hmm...

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:51.630
I'd seduce all the girls around 
me and start a harem.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.470
You're such total scum, 
it actually puts me at ease.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.830
I'm not telling you to 
hurt any of the girls.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.470
In fact, I'm telling you to 
just make them all happy.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.750
And if the result deviates a bit 
from what's considered the norm,

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:06.970
what's wrong with that?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:10.530
Isn't it more important that the 
people you care about are happy?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:14.050
In other words, it's both 
kindness and humanism.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:15.930
Just how demonic are you?

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:19.310
I bet when you die, it's gonna 
be because a woman stabbed you.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.720
Isn't that how every man wants to die?

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:25.830
The fact that I even vaguely understand 
the trashy things you say scares me.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:32.030
Whew, good. No one heard me.

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:35.310
Man, it's hot. Let's go get some ice cream.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.210
Sure.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.340
We can't tell him we actually did hear.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.420
This is normal for them, honestly.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:47.360
I don't even think a thing of hearing 
them talk like that anymore.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.950
Really?

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:52.790
I never would've thought of it, 
so I found it very informative.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.290
Informative?

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:58.200
Sueharu-oniichan isn't like Tetsuhiko-san.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.780
He tends to lean more on 
common sense and logic.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.740
That's why he's drawn to 
Tetsuhiko-san's ideas,

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:10.790
but part of him also envies how 
he's so true to his own desires.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.990
Oh, yeah, I guess so.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:17.950
Finding out that Sueharu-oniichan 
doesn't totally lack interest

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.670
in having a harem was a 
new discovery for me.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.950
But what good does it do to discover that?

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:28.230
Rena-san, what position do 
you think I'm in right now?

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.670
You mean romantically, right?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.780
Correct!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.680
If you want me to be honest,

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.880
I think you're falling 
behind the other two.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:40.010
Oh, but I don't mean in 
terms of personal charm!

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:42.470
Thank you for being honest.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:44.710
That's what I think, too.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:49.050
Romantically, I'm falling behind 
Kuroha-san and Shirokusa-san.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:52.320
That said, I'm not drastically far behind.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:57.180
I think it's only because I'm 
not a romantic interest yet.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.960
Wow... You're so cool-headed 
about all this.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.980
Which means the best thing for me

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:05.910
is to make him aware of 
me while the two of them

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:09.990
are preventing each other from 
getting together with him.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.370
I get it.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:15.860
The general understanding of a harem is 
that the guy's chosen all the girls,

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:20.190
but you could also say it means 
he won't just choose one.

