00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.810
I call it Sueharu-oniichan's 
Plan for the Three Kingdoms!

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:29.320
That sounds like Paisen's only future is 
being torn into pieces by three jealous girls.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.320
Our villa will be coming into sight soon.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:36.760
What do you think, Su-chan?

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:40.490
My sincerest thanks for allowing 
us to accompany you, milady.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.610
H-Huh?!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.340
I am ready to obey any order you may have.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.380
Wait... Stop that, Su-chan!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.130
I am delighted that you 
address me with such ease.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.570
Supremely delighted!

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:53.960
Su-chan! You just sound weird now!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.730
Sueharu's really something, huh?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.850
He has no resistance to people 
with money and power.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.380
Peasants are weak in the face of greatness.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.400
Are you, too?

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.450
I still have my pride!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.990
Can't you two choose your 
words a little better?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.700
Especially you, Rena! I know 
you're making fun of me!

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.400
Frankly... yeah, I am.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.030
Don't think I'll let you off the 
hook just because you were honest!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:17.030
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.780
No bullying your juniors!

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:22.150
All right, all right. Shirokusa-chan, 
unlock the door.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.670
Come on, everyone has to carry something.
 Especially the boys!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.900
Your bedrooms are on the first floor.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.590
There are five bedrooms, 
each with two beds.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.670
As for how to split up the rooms...

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.830
Sueharu-chan and I will share a room!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.480
You're so bold, Maria.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:52.090
Okay, so Momosaka-san and her 
sister will get one room.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.110
Kachi-senpai's a pro at 
ignoring provocation!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.490
Su-chan and Kai-kun will share one room,

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.810
Asagi-san and I will share one room,

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:03.800
and the four Shida sisters can have the 
last two rooms. How does that sound?

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.250
No objections.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.750
Also, the bath is on the third floor.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.800
You can get a nice view from the terrace,

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:12.530
but the stars at night look 
better from the bath.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:18.280
Shiro, I've got a good idea.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.800
We could all put on our swimsuits 
and get in the bath toge—

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.960
Do you really think I'll allow 
something so salacious?

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.520
Well, Su-chan? Do you?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.430
S-Sorry. Just kidding.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.870
Hey, is it possible to 
dive in from up here?

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:33.980
Yes.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:35.940
All right, got it.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.300
Go to hell!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.990
Damn it, Tetsuhiko!

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.090
Take this!

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.600
Ah, youth.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:59.250
Impressive, Kuro-nee. I can't believe 
you got this far in just a few days.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.380
Well, I did promise Tetsuhiko-kun.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.000
It's not just that, is it?

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:08.990
It's more than just the dance practice.
 For Haru-nii, you're...

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.830
Well, I'm basically his older sister.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.080
Even though you're fighting?

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.220
That's one thing. This is another.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.100
You really are amazing.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:21.420
He might be out having fun as we speak.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:28.170
It seems likely that he's using your absence 
as a chance to skip out on studying.

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:30.470
And since he's such a pervert,

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.390
he might be gawking at the other girls.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:39.390
Oh? What's the matter, Sueharu-oniichan?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:44.030
It's not often I put on a swimsuit. 
You should take a better look.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.550
Wait, Momo!

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:49.410
Did that make your heart pound?

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:52.130
You're so kyoote! Kyoote, kyoote, kyoote!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:55.450
Okay, fine, I get it. 
Just don't get any closer!

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.920
Telling me that won't do you any good.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.280
There, there!

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:06.360
A-Aoi, sorry to interrupt 
your club meeting,

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:08.940
but I need you to get home 
as soon as possible.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:12.210
I don't think I can hold 
Kuro-nee back by myself.

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.170
Why don't you stop filming 
and go play with them?

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:23.220
Can I?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.650
Since we're not allowed 
to film the swimsuits,

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.840
there's no point in shooting 
footage we can't use.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.140
You look adorable!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.730
Hi-yah!

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.210
Damn it, Tetsuhiko! What was that for?!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.250
Well, you were spacing out.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.550
That was a prompt to get 
me to attack you, right?

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:53.670
If that's an attack cue, 
I can never space out again!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:58.380
<b>Kachi Shirokusa  New Message 

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:56.310
Oh...

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.370
<i>I want to show you my swimsuit,</i>

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.590
<i>but not in front of everyone.</i>

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.390
<i>If you step outside the front 
door and head to the right,</i>

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.100
<i>you'll find a small beach.</i>

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.500
<i>I want to show you there in secret.</i>

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:11.120
Oops! Just remembered something I gotta do!

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.640
Back, clear!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:13.810
Front door, clear!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.080
Now head right!

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:19.020
I can't wait! Dash!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.000
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>\hEpisode 8 
Shirokusa's Counterattack</b>

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>Oho...</b>

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>I wonder where he ran off to...</b>

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.260
Sorry for the wait, Su-chan.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:41.950
What's wrong?

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.140
Uh, nothing...

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:45.500
Su-chan?

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.700
Oh, that's it?!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.410
What do you mean, "that's it"?

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.310
Well, you said you were gonna 
show me your swimsuit.

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:01.660
To be honest, I expected 
something like a bikini.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:06.090
I just put this cover on because I 
didn't want the others to see me!

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:06.780
Huh?

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.480
This is what I wanted to show you.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.540
What do you think?

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:22.010
U-Um... I-I'm not sure what to say...

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.980
That doesn't tell me anything.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.460
Give me more details.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:28.160
Well, Su-chan?

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:31.680
It looks great on you! 
I think you look gorgeous!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.450
Seriously, I'm really, 
really moved right now!

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.180
You're beautiful!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.870
What's wrong, Shiro?

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:40.550
I'm fine. I'm fine, Su-chan.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:44.820
I'm just so happy. I've wanted to 
hear you say that for so long.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.020
Shiro, are you sure you're okay?

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.920
May I sit with you?

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.380
Y-Yeah, of course.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.370
Uh, hello?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.820
You certainly seem to be enjoying yourself,
 Sueharu-oniichan.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.040
Momo?! You were watching?!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.540
<i>I was filming.</i>

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.900
At least keep it to just watching!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:44.160
And tell the guy next to you 
to drop dead right now!

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.000
<i>Right... Okay.</i>

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.950
<i>Oh, Sueharu-oniichan?</i>

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:50.600
<i>I have a message from 
the person next to me.</i>

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.500
<i>He says, "I got video of 
Shirokusa-san in her swimsuit.</i>

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.630
<i>Want me to send you the data?"</i>

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:58.440
I mean, hell yes, I want it!

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:04.800
<i>By the way, I was going to run out 
and interrupt you right away,</i>

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:09.930
<i>but I held back because Tetsuhiko-san 
wanted to record more.</i>

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.600
Huh? O-Oh...

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.620
So you should know that I'm very angry.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:16.500
<b>Calling</b>

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:16.830
<b>Momosaka Maria</b>

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:16.830
<b>Call Ended</b>

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:19.690
You won't get away, Sueharu-oniichan!

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.030
Get off of me, Momo!

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:27.100
No! I want to sit in your lap, too!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.560
Momosaka-san, that's enough!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.300
Come on, both of you!

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:36.550
Don't worry about it.

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:41.270
Sueharu-oniichan, I'll kill 
you and then myself!

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:42.560
Calm the eff down, Momo!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.640
Paisen, your hands aren't moving.

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.700
Try looking at reality instead of Momo-chi.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:54.960
Just a little won't hurt.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:15:00.860
Oh, but I heard you were a scholarship 
student who's always at the top of your grade.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:05.250
Paisen, did you actually 
think I was stupid?

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.980
Well, you're just like me, aren't you?

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:10.580
Seriously, please don't put 
me on the same level as you.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:13.140
You little...

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.840
No bullying your tutor!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.850
Yeah? How do you like that?

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.710
Wow, Momo's really something, huh?

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.800
This is the first time I've 
really seen her as an actress.

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.810
There's nothing to even critique.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:26.000
Okay, Kachi, you're up next.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:34.750
Is Kachi-senpai nervous?

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.230
Kachi...

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:40.210
What?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.050
You're not cute at all.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:44.280
Well, sorry I'm not good at this!

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:47.500
I didn't say you're not good. 
I said you're not cute.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:50.030
Well, sorry I'm not cute!

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.710
That's not the point. I'm saying 
you should try to look cuter.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.440
You make it sound so easy.

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.150
Tetsuhiko...

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.150
I don't know if it'll be a good example,

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.170
but can I try doing the dance once?

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:05.340
Can you, though? You haven't practiced it.

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:07.940
I've mastered the basic movements.

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:10.930
Though I won't be singing, 
of course. Just dancing.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.150
Su-chan...

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.410
Okay, sure. Go for it.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.460
I feel the urge to kill.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.710
Ditto.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:31.880
What I really can't stand is that I thought 
he looked cute for just a second.

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:36.270
Seeing the look that comes to his face 
when he suddenly comes to his senses

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:38.090
is just depressing.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:42.550
Right now, I'm just cursing the god 
who gave that moron so much talent.

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.660
You're amazing, Sueharu-oniichan!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:51.140
Other than the fact that it's gross 
when a boy does it, that was perfect!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:53.460
Was that a compliment or an insult?

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:55.060
A compliment, of course.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:56.400
What'd you think, Shiro?

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.650
You really are amazing, Su-chan.

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.570
Hey, Shiro...

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:06.330
Remember how I couldn't dance until 
just recently because of my trauma?

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:10.740
What made me able to do it again 
was something really small.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:14.400
It was... deciding to 
dance for someone else.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.940
For... someone else?

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.590
Is there anyone you want to dance for?

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:23.820
If not, is there anyone 
you want to smile for?

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.600
Su-chan... Thank you.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:39.520
Sueharu-oniichan, when you finish 
with that, could you help me?

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.490
Sure. What do you want me to do?

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:45.860
Just hold me tight, so I don't go far away.

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.710
Could you not just hit me 
like that out of the blue?!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.000
The shock is too much!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.840
I was actually half-joking.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.500
I'm making chanko nabe, 
so I could use a hand.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:57.460
Okay, I get it now, but why only half?

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:00.620
Would you prefer if I'd 
only been 10% joking?

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.720
That's not where I was going with that!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:04.800
Wait, where's Shiro?

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:08.860
She just walked out the front door 
earlier without saying a word.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:09.920
Wait, wha—

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.370
Sueharu-oniichan!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:13.640
What?

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:17.900
I'm not all that concerned 
about this cooking contest.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.970
Huh? What makes you say this now?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.160
No particular reason.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.870
O-Okay...

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:35.530
I practiced making it because 
I heard it was Su-chan's favorite.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:40.200
So why hotpot? How do you even make hotpot?

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.800
Do you just boil stuff? 
Is that all it takes?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.940
There are too many recipes out there.
 I don't know what to do.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.390
Shiro...

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.520
Wh-What is it, Su-chan?

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.690
I'd kind of like to be alone right now.

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:57.400
Shiro, do you feel like you have 
to act tough around me, too?

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.440
I know the old Shiro.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.490
There's no need to hide any 
weakness from me now, is there?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:08.820
I know there was a time when you didn't even 
want to step outside the gate to your house,

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.420
so you actually cried.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.010
I'm not the same person I was then!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:17.490
I got stronger! Strong enough to 
stand on even footing with you!

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.970
Shiro...

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.940
I won't say I don't care whether 
you're strong or not,

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:28.750
but I don't think it's good 
to fixate too much on it.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.410
If devoting too much of yourself 
to get stronger makes you suffer,

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.190
I don't want you to try that hard.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.760
Being too weak might not be a good thing,

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:40.390
but aren't there things more 
important than being strong?

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:43.160
What are you trying to say, Su-chan?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:47.090
I think being honest is more important.

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:52.710
It looks to me like you're digging your own 
grave because you can't just be honest.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:58.610
I understand what you're saying...
 but I'm scared.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:04.060
You've never even seen anyone 
make hotpot before, have you?

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.080
How do you know?

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.920
I kind of overheard.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:10.430
Also, you practiced making 
my favorite food?

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:11.930
You heard that, too?!

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:13.750
Only bits and pieces.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.380
I wanted to look good without 
having to say anything!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:18.200
Thanks, Shiro.

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:22.530
It makes me really happy that 
you practiced just for me.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.070
Make some for me sometime.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:26.410
B-But it's a hotpot challenge...

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:28.600
Who cares? It'll work out.

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.320
What did you practice making?

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.250
Fried chicken.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.280
That really is my favorite!

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.800
Did you get the stuff to make it?

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.580
I did, just in case.

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:40.450
Then there's no problem!

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.760
I'll make up some excuse 
to give the others.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:45.280
Just focus on cooking and 
don't worry about a thing.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:52.050
You so easily do things that I can't.

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.220
That's not true.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.830
I can't write novels like you.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:21:00.300
You always pinpoint the good things 
about whoever you're with.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:04.250
I'm a stubborn, pessimistic coward,

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.040
but you give me so much 
courage and strength.

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.880
<i>I think you should be wary 
of the magic of travel.</i>

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.200
We should head back.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:37.110
Yeah.

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:58.840
Well, you sure seem to be 
having a good time, Haru...

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.250
Without me and all.

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:04.210
Kuro!
